OL,3,AWhat can I do to protect myself after
OL,4,A'Asos hacked' message?
OL,5,
OL,6,FOn Tuesday morning, Asos users across
OL,7,Fthe UK were sent pop-up messages from
OL,8,Fits app that appear to have been sent
OL,9,Fby hackers trying to extort the
OL,10,Fcompany.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
